        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sheridan%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Once the richest pine stand in Michigan, Sheridan’s lumber camps powered early businesses that sprang up around the area.",
